wned": 568, "num_reviews": 154, "playtime_forever": 190, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 124, "last_played": 1780404300, "avatar": "efe09022f404bb3602128b84c589d7b8f3010bf3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain is what happens when a game completely loses control of itself and somehow becomes better because of it.\r\n\r\nYou start the run jumping around like “nice, simple little indie game” and then 40 minutes later the screen looks like a microwave full of fireworks. Enemies everywhere, missiles flying, your character bouncing off walls at mach 6, and some giant jellyfish sniping you from another zip code.\r\n\r\nThe best part is you barely even know what your items do anymore. You just keep picking up random crap like a goblin. “Oh cool, a rusty spoon that increases violence by 2%.” Sure. Why not.\r\n\r\nAbsolute chaos. Absolute peak.\r\n\r\nxeneizero says 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1779842077, "timestamp_updated": 1779842077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.648583769798278809", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "226483853", "author": {"steamid": "76561198166394310", "personaname": "Miskunho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/miskunho/", "num_games_owned": 15, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2321, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2321, "last_played": 1541937473, "avatar": "73e6fb7eae97e10d41bf56a97cdfc1232ed8cecd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, but I just cannot get my controller to work with it no matter what I try.", "timestamp_created": 1779819873, "timestamp_updated": 1779819873, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52380955219268798